ing area and review them before anything is removed. Nothing is deleted without your confirmation.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nAll scanning runs on your device. Your photos and data never leave your iPhone and are never uploaded to any server.\n\nWHY FAST CLEANER\n• Fast, on-device scanning\n• The best photo in each group is kept automatically\n• Free up gigabytes without losing the moments you want to keep\n\nSUBSCRIPTION\nFast Cleaner offers a Weekly plan (with a 3-day free trial) and a Yearly plan for unlimited cleaning.\n• Payment is charged to your Apple Account at confirmation of purchase.\n• A subscription automatically renews unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\n• Manage or cancel anytime in your App Store account settings.\n• Terms of Use (EULA): https://sites.google.com/view/fast-cleaner-legal/terms-of-use\n• Privacy Policy: \n    https://sites.google.com/view/fast-cleaner-legal/privacy-policy", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion": 0, "averageUserRating": 0, "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/fast-cleaner-clean-up-space/id6783264743?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "trackCensoredName": "Fast Cleaner: Clean Up Space", "releaseDate": "2026-07-10T07:00:00Z", "bundleId": "com.tooltechnology.fastcleaner", "userRatingCount": 0}]}